# Repository Rules

## Non-Negotiable
- Never use Copilot, copilot, or external AI coding assistants
- Follow conventional commits: type(scope): message
- Author commits with real identity (not github-actions)
- Always validate before committing: pnpm run check:fast

## Code Style
- TypeScript strict mode is enabled
- Single quotes, semicolons, trailing commas
- Print width 120, tab width 2
- Line endings: LF
- No console.log, no non-null assertions (!)
- No 'any' type (use unknown instead)

## Testing
- Every public function must have a test
- Coverage target: 100% (see per-project overrides)
- Use Vitest for unit/component tests
- Use Playwright for E2E tests
- Test factories in libs/backend/common/test/

## Workspace
- 41 projects in Nx monorepo
- Module boundaries enforced by ESLint (@nx/enforce-module-boundaries)
- Platform constraints: backend→backend|shared, frontend→frontend|shared
- Path aliases: @app/backend/*, @app/frontend/*, @app/common/*
